"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le18ob08re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le18ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le18ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le18ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "Subject Line: Time to talk ... <br />\n<br />\nDear Peter,<br />\n<br />You and I have been close friends for years. Some have said that we were more like siblings than buddies. I cherish our friendship and the memories we have shared. However, I feel that you might be pulling away from the group. You seem distant, cold and to be honest ...  a little self absorbed. The last time I saw you, you spent most of the time on your cellphone, complaining about your workload or fixing your hair.", "id": 1}, {"time": "31800", "image": "engenn9le18ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "Sally said that you had declined the invitation to throw axes on Sunday because you had so much work to do. She also intimated that you had thought axe throwing was a silly idea.Later, a friend of mine told me that she had seen you having drinks at a bistro downtown. I thought that it might have been a case of mistaken identity until she described your favorite T-shirt. I felt quite betrayed and am hoping that it is just a huge misunderstanding. Friendship is a matter of trust, isn't it?", "id": 2}, {"time": "66300", "image": "engenn9le18ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "If you preferred to to do something else or spend time with others you should have told me.  I was hurt and insulted when I realized I had been lied to. We've always been able to be honest with each other, haven't we? I realize that relationships have their ups and down, it's not always smooth sailing. However, I don't want us to be like two ships passing in the night, do you? I care about you too much.  Are friendship is worth fighting for, isn't it?<br />\n<br />Your disheartened friend,<br /><br />Vanessa", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "5000", "image": "", "text": "Writing an e-mail", "id": 1}, {"time": "16000", "image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Parts of an e-mail.</span>", "id": 2}, {"time": "68000", "image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Include reported speech.</span>", "id": 3}], "video_src": "engenn9le18ob08re3vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}